<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to December 6.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Fletcher Building	  3.66	     6.40</p>
<p>2   Rothmans		     8.00	     3.90</p>
<p>3   Newcrest Mining	    4.67	     3.78</p>
<p>4   Sons of Gwalia	     6.90	     2.99</p>
</text>
